diff": null, "latency_ms": 1.4193999995768536, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:36e31d14527f0872ccb5f51950799da65fb09ef75692732e9254423bf83e5608", "final_hash": "sha256:2192e1b2659741b1b61d6ac77a9756556233fae99d7698e53e0d9ecf4fd5f5aa", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1409, "output_tokens": 275, "latency_ms": 5907.326600000488, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我需要先查看页面列表来找到主监控页面，同时对项目进行校验。让我执行这两个操作。", "reasoning": "用户想要做两件事：\n1. 把主监控页面的背景色改成白色\n2. 重新校验项目\n\n当前阶段是 VALIDATE，可用工具包括：\n- deployment: 可以用于 validate_project 和 show_deployment_status\n- manage_pages: 可以用于 list_pages\n- manage_history: 可以用于 list_history\n- manage_scripts: 可以用于 list_scripts\n\n要修改页面背景色，这属于页面配置操作。但 manage_pages 工具目前只允许 list_pages，没有修改页面的 action。这意味着在当前阶段，我无法直接修改页面背景色。\n\n不过，我可以先调用 list_pages 来获取页面列表，找到\"主监控页面\"的ID，但修改操作在当前工具限制下无法执行。\n\n用户还要求\"重新校验项目\"，这个可以使用 deployment 工具的 validate_project action。\n\n让我先列出页面，然后说明当前阶段无法修改页面背景色，同时执行项目校验。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1504, "output_tokens": 347, "latency_ms": 8242.781300000388, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "## 执行结果\n\n### 1. 项目校验 ✅\n项目校验已成功完成，状态为 **validated**，无任何错误。\n\n### 2. 页面背景色修改 ⚠️\n已找到主页面信息：\n- **页面ID**: `main_page`\n- **页面名称**: 主页面\n\n但是，当前处于 **VALIDATE 阶段**，此阶段的工具仅支持页面查询，**不支持修改页面配置**（如背景色）。要修改页面背景色，需要切换到允许页面配置的阶段。\n\n---\n\n**需要切换到页面配置阶段以完成背景色修改。** \n\nnext_state: ANALYZE_INTENT\n\n切换后，您可以再次告诉我\"把主监控页面的背景色改成白色\"，届时将能够执行该配置操作。", "reasoning": "结果：\n1. 页面列表显示只有一个页面：id=\"main_page\"，name=\"主页面\"\n2. 项目校验已成功通过，状态是\"validated\"，没有错误\n\n现在的问题是：用户想要修改主监控页面的背景色，但在当前 VALIDATE 阶段，manage_pages 工具只允许 list_pages 操作，没有 update_page 或类似的操作。要修改页面配置，可能需要切换到其他阶段。\n\n根据行为准则第5条，如果当前阶段的可用工具不满足需求，我应该在回复中包含 \"next_state: 阶段名\" 来切换到合适的阶段。\n\n我需要告诉用户：\n1. 项目校验已通过\n2. 关于修改背景色，当前阶段的工具限制无法直接修改页面配置，需要切换到可以修改页面的阶段"}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1905, "output_tokens": 329, "latency_ms": 8064.42909999987, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "## 意图分析\n\n您的需求包含两个任务：\n\n| 任务 | 描述 | 需要的阶段 |\n|------|------|-----------|\n| 1 | 修改主监控页面背景色为白色 | **MANAGE_PAGES** |\n| 2 | 重新校验项目 | VALIDATE |\n\n### 分析结果\n\n要修改页面背景色，需要切换到 **MANAGE_PAGES 阶段**，该阶段具备页面配置能力。\n\n> 📌 注意：项目校验已在上一步成功完成（状态：validated，无错误）。\n\n---\n\n**建议切换到 MANAGE_PAGES 阶段以完成背景色修改。**\n\nnext_state: MANAGE_PAGES", "reasoning": "用户让我进入 ANALYZE_INTENT 阶段，继续完成任务。用户的任务是：\n1. 把主监控页面的背景色改成白色\n2. 重新校验项目\n\n在 ANALYZE_INTENT 阶段，我需要分析用户意图，但根据系统提示，当前可用工具只有 deployment 工具。我需要查看一下当前阶段可以切换到哪些阶段。\n\n根据提示，当前阶段的可切换下一阶段包括：ASK_USER, BIND_POINTS, CONFIG_ALARM, CONFIG_HISTORY, CONFIG_POINT, CONFIG_SCRIPT, DEPLOY, DONE, GENERATE_LAYOUT, MANAGE_PAGES, VALIDATE\n\n要修改页面背景色，应该切换到 MANAGE_PAGES 阶段。让我分析用户意图并建议切换到合适的阶段。\n\n由于修改页面背景色需要页面配置能力，我应该切换到 MANAGE_PAGES 阶段。"}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2247, "output_tokens": 194, "latency_ms": 3718.164799999613, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "在 MANAGE_PAGES 阶段，我现在可以修改页面配置。让我将主监控页面的背景色修改为白色。", "reasoning": "用户已进入 MANAGE_PAGES 阶段，我需要使用当前可用工具完成修改主监控页面背景色的任务。\n\n让我先查看当前阶段的可用工具。用户之前的需求是：\n1. 把主监控页面的背景色改成白色\n2. 重新校验项目\n\n在之前的调用中，我已经知道主页面的ID是 \"main_page\"。\n\n在 MANAGE_PAGES 阶段，应该有 manage_pages 工具可用，可能包括 update_page 等操作。让我尝试调用 manage_pages 工具来修改页面背景色。"}, {"turn": 5, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2632, "output_tokens": 360, "latency_ms": 8476.789199999985, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "根据可用的 action 列表，没有直接的 `update_page` 操作。让我尝试使用 `set_parameter` 来设置页面的背景色参数。", "reasoning": "用户告诉我已进入 MANAGE_PAGES 阶段。根据之前的错误信息，我看到 manage_pages 工具允许的 actions 包括：\n- bind_point\n- create_certificate\n- create_limit\n- create_page\n- create_port\n- create_protocol\n- create_widget\n- delete_group\n- delete_page\n- delete_phase\n- delete_record\n- get_backup\n- get_buffer\n- get_module\n- get_screen\n- list_pages\n- rename_page\n- set_gateway\n- set_parameter\n- set_pump\n- set_schedule\n- test_history\n- update_policy\n- update_recipe\n- update_topic\n- update_vessel\n- verify_endpoint\n- verify_profile\n- verify_tank\n- verify_template\n\n看起来没有直接的 \"update_page\" 操作。我需要找到其他方式来修改页面背景色。\n\n可能的方式：\n1. 使用 \"set_parameter\" 来设置页面参数\n2. 使用 \"get_screen\" 来获取页面详细信息，看看是否有其他方法\n\n让我先尝试使用 set_parameter 来设置页面的背景色参数，或者先用 get_screen 获取页面信息。\n\n实际上，从工具列表来看，\"set_parameter\" 可能是用来设置页面参数的。让我尝试使用 set_parameter 来设置主页面的背景色。"}, {"turn": 6, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 3183, "output_tokens": 253, "latency_ms": 4996.650000000045, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "让我先使用 `get_screen` 获取主页面的详细配置信息，了解页面的配置结构。", "reasoning": "让我查看一下 manage_pages 工具的可用 actions 列表。根据错误信息，允许的 actions 包括：\n- bind_point\n- create_certificate\n- create_limit\n- create_page\n- create_port\n- create_protocol\n- create_widget\n- delete_group\n- delete_page\n- delete_phase\n- delete_record\n- get_backup\n- get_buffer\n- get_module\n- get_screen\n- list_pages\n- rename_page\n- set_gateway\n- set_parameter\n- set_pump\n- set_schedule\n- test_history\n- update_policy\n- update_recipe\n- update_topic\n- update_vessel\n- verify_endpoint\n- verify_profile\n- verify_tank\n- verify_template\n\n看起来 \"set_parameter\" 是存在的，但是之前调用时出现了错误。可能是参数名或参数格式不对。\n\n让我尝试使用 \"get_screen\" 来获取页面的详细信息，看看页面配置的结构是什么样的。"}, {"turn": 7, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 3627, "output_tokens": 338, "latency_ms": 6847.588000000542, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "让我尝试使用 `set_parameter` 并以正确的参数格式调用。", "reasoning": "用户让我进入 MANAGE_PAGES 阶段，但之前尝试的 update_page 和 set_parameter 都失败了。错误信息显示可用的 actions 列表。\n\n让我仔细查看可用的 actions：\n- bind_point\n- create_certificate\n- create_limit\n- create_page\n- create_port\n- create_protocol\n- create_widget\n- delete_group\n- delete_page\n- delete_phase\n- delete_record\n- get_backup\n- get_buffer\n- get_module\n- get_screen\n- list_pages\n- rename_page\n- set_gateway\n- set_parameter\n- set_pump\n- set_schedule\n- test_history\n- update_policy\n- update_recipe\n- update_topic\n- update_vessel\n- verify_endpoint\n- verify_profile\n- verify_tank\n- verify_template\n\n看起来 set_parameter 是可用的，但我之前的调用格式可能不对。错误信息说 \"unknown action 'update_page'\"，这说明工具在调用时仍然使用了错误的 action。\n\n让我再次尝试 set_parameter，但需要确保参数格式正确。可能我需要传递正确的参数。让我查看工具定义...\n\n根据工具定义，manage_pages 的参数应该符合 JSON Schema。但工具定义中没有详细列出所有参数。\n\n让我尝试使用 set_parameter，并传递正确的参数格式。可能需要传递 parameters 对象而不是单独的参数。"}, {"turn": 8, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 4156, "output_tokens": 334, "latency_ms": 7539.242199999535, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "让我尝试使用 `set_parameter` 并用正确的参数名称格式来设置页面背景色。", "reasoning": "The system keeps telling me I'm in MANAGE_PAGES stage, but the tool calls are failing with schema errors. The error message says \"unknown action 'update_page'\" even though I'm not trying to use 'update_page' - I'm trying to use 'set_parameter' or 'get_screen'. \n\nThis suggests there might be an issue with how the tool is processing my requests. Let me try with minimal parameters and see what happens.\n\nLooking at the allowed actions again:\n- bind_point, create_certificate, create_limit, create_page, create_port, create_protocol, create_widget, delete_group, delete_page, delete_phase, delete_record, get_backup, get_buffer, get_module, get_screen, list_pages, rename_page, set_gateway, set_parameter, set_pump, set_schedule, test_history, update_policy, update_recipe, update_topic, update_vessel, verify_endpoint, verify_profile, verify_tank, verify_template\n\nLet me try using set_parameter with just the action and see what parameters it expects. Or maybe I should try a different approach - like creating a new page with the desired background color using create_page, or checking if there's a way to set the background through the existing allowed actions.\n\nActually, let me try calling set_parameter with minimal required parameters."}, {"turn": 9, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 4681, "output_tokens": 902, "latency_ms": 21577.536199999486, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "## 当前情况分析\n\n我遇到了一个技术问题：系统提示 `manage_pages` 工具存在，但每次调用都返回错误。\n\n根据错误信息，`set_parameter` 确实是 `manage_pages` 域下的允许动作之一，但调用仍然失败。这可能是工具配置或参数格式问题。\n\n### 已完成的任务 ✅\n\n**项目校验**已在之前的阶段成功完成：\n- 状态：validated\n- 错误：无\n\n### 未完成的任务 ⚠️\n\n**修改主页面背景色为白色** - 由于工具调用持续失败，无法完成此操作。\n\n---\n\n**建议方案：**\n\n1. 如果页面背景色修改不是关键需求，可以先完成其他任务\n2. 如果必须修改背景色，可能需要通过其他途径（如手动配置或联系系统管理员）\n\n请问您希望如何继续？\n\n- 继续其他配置任务？\n- 结束当前任务（项目校验已完成）？\n- 其他需求？\n\nnext_state: DONE", "reasoning": "The error message keeps saying \"unknown action 'update_page'\" even though I'm passing \"set_parameter\" as the action. This is strange - it seems like there might be an issue with the tool itself or the tool definition is not matching what I'm trying to do.\n\nLet me re-read the tool definition carefully. The tool is called \"deployment\" with actions like validate_project, deploy_project, etc. But I was trying to call \"manage_pages\" which is not in the available tools list.\n\nLooking back at the available tools:\n- deployment: Project validation, deployment, rollback, status. Actions: validate_project, deploy_project, show_deployment_status, rollback_deployment\n\nI don't have a \"manage_pages\" tool available! That's why all my calls are failing. I was calling a tool that doesn't exist.\n\nIn the current stage MANAGE_PAGES, I should only have access to the tools listed. Let me check what tools are actually available:\n- deployment: with actions validate_project, deploy_project, show_deployment_status, rollback_deployment\n\nSo I cannot modify page background color with the available tools. The manage_pages tool is not available in this context.\n\nI need to inform the user that modifying the background color is not possible with the current available tools, and suggest an alternative approach or indicate that we should move to a different stage or complete the task with what's available.\n\nActually, looking at the error message more carefully - it says \"unknown action 'update_page' for domain 'manage_pages'\" - this suggests the tool \"manage_pages\" might exist but the action is wrong. But the allowed actions listed don't include anything for setting background color either.\n\nLet me reconsider - perhaps I need to look at what actions are available in the manage_pages domain based on the error message:\n- bind_point, create_certificate, create_limit, create_page, create_port, create_protocol, create_widget, delete_group, delete_page, delete_phase, delete_record, get_backup, get_buffer, get_module, get_screen, list_pages, rename_page, set_gateway, set_parameter, set_pump, set_schedule, test_history, update_policy, update_recipe, update_topic, update_vessel, verify_endpoint, verify_profile, verify_tank, verify_template\n\nI see \"set_parameter\" is in the allowed actions list! But my call to set_parameter is also failing with the same error. This is confusing.\n\nLet me try a different approach - maybe I need to use the correct parameter format for set_parameter. Looking at the allowed actions, I should try:\n- set_parameter with some specific parameters\n\nBut wait, the error says \"unknown action 'update_page'\" which suggests the system is interpreting my call as \"update_page\" even though I'm passing \"set_parameter\". This might be a bug in the system or I'm not understanding the tool correctly.\n\nActually, I realize I should check the tool definition again. The tool I have access to is:\n- deployment: with actions validate_project, deploy_project, show_deployment_status, rollback_deployment\n\nI don't have a \"manage_pages\" tool! That's the issue. The MANAGE_PAGES stage doesn't have the manage_pages tool available - that's contradictory.\n\nLet me just inform the user that I cannot complete the background color modification with the current available tools, and ask what they want to do next."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 5, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "DeploymentCheck"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 253