rty参数。\n\n让我先询问用户具体要绑定到哪个属性。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 5, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 1685, "output_tokens": 397, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 8681.851800000004}, "judge": null}
