, "output_tokens": 316, "latency_ms": 7154.933400000118, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我理解您的需求：需要创建3个模拟量输入(AI)点位 TI-201、PI-201、FI-201，并配置历史归档。\n\n当前阶段我只能查看已有的点位和历史配置，还无法直接创建。让我先检查一下现有的点位情况，然后切换到配置阶段。", "reasoning": "The user wants to add 3 IO points: TI-201, PI-201, FI-201, all AI (Analog Input) type, with history enabled.\n\nHowever, looking at my current available tools:\n- `manage_points`: only has `list_points` action available\n- `manage_history`: only has `list_history` action available\n\nI don't have the ability to CREATE points or history configurations in this stage. The current stage is ANALYZE_INTENT, and I can only list points and list history configurations.\n\nI need to inform the user that I need to switch to a different stage (CONFIG_POINT) to be able to create points. Let me check the available next states: ASK_USER, BIND_POINTS, CONFIG_ALARM, CONFIG_HISTORY, CONFIG_POINT, CONFIG_SCRIPT, DEPLOY, DONE, GENERATE_LAYOUT, MANAGE_PAGES, VALIDATE\n\nCONFIG_POINT seems like the right stage to create points. I should switch to that stage.\n\nBut first, let me check if the points already exist by listing current points."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1712, "output_tokens": 760, "latency_ms": 15577.399599999808, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "当前阶段我可以直接为标签启用历史归档配置。我来为 TI-201、PI-201、FI-201 三个点位同时启用历史记录：", "reasoning": "The user is telling me I'm in the CONFIG_HISTORY stage. Let me review the current tools available:\n\n1. manage_history: with actions enable_history, list_history, set_retention\n2. manage_points: with action list_points only\n\nThe user wants to create 3 AI points (TI-201, PI-201, FI-201) with history enabled. However, I can only LIST points, not CREATE them. And for history, I can enable_history, list_history, or set_retention.\n\nThe problem is: I cannot CREATE the points themselves in this stage - I can only list them. The points don't exist yet (as confirmed by the list_points call showing 0 points).\n\nHowever, looking at the manage_history tool, the enable_history action \"Turns on historian sampling for a tag (creates the config if needed)\". This suggests it might work even if the point doesn't exist yet, or it might require the point to already exist.\n\nSince the current workflow step is \"enable_history_if_missing\", it seems like the intent here is specifically to enable history for tags. Let me try to enable history for these 3 tags. But I cannot create the actual points in this stage.\n\nI should inform the user that:\n1. The points themselves need to be created in CONFIG_POINT stage\n2. I can try to enable history for these tags in this stage, but the points may need to exist first\n\nActually, let me re-read the instructions. It says \"当前阶段的可用工具不满足需求，你可以在回复的纯文本中包含 'next_state: 阶段名' 来切换到合适的阶段\".\n\nSo I should:\n1. Explain that I can't create points in this stage\n2. Switch to CONFIG_POINT stage to create the points first\n3. Then come back to CONFIG_HISTORY to enable history\n\nBut wait - the user's message says \"请使用当前可用工具继续完成任务\" (please use current available tools to continue). This is a system message telling me to proceed with what I have.\n\n\nI'll attempt to enable history for all 3 tags simultaneously since the enable_history action can create configs as needed. The tool might accept the tags even if the underlying points don't exist yet - worth trying."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2597, "output_tokens": 248, "latency_ms": 5464.850400000614, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "历史归档配置失败了，原因是 **TI-201、PI-201、FI-201 这三个点位尚不存在**。要启用历史归档，必须先创建点位本身。\n\n**当前问题：** CONFIG_HISTORY 阶段只能配置历史，无法创建点位。\n\n**需要的操作步骤：**\n1. 先切换到 **CONFIG_POINT** 阶段 → 创建 3 个 AI 点位\n2. 再回到 **CONFIG_HISTORY** 阶段 → 为它们启用历史归档\n\n建议切换到 CONFIG_POINT 阶段来创建这三个点位：\n\nnext_state: CONFIG_POINT", "reasoning": "The history enable failed because the points don't exist yet. I need to first create the points in CONFIG_POINT stage, then come back to CONFIG_HISTORY to enable history.\n\nCurrent situation:\n- Points TI-201, PI-201, FI-201 don't exist yet\n- I'm in CONFIG_HISTORY stage which cannot create points\n- I need to switch to CONFIG_POINT stage to create the points first\n\nI should explain this to the user and suggest switching to CONFIG_POINT stage first."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 5, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "HistoryQuery"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 5298, "output_tokens": 1324, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 28213.34990000014}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "732883a3-06da-414c-8586-5d444de0b080", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:17072e90aec915fe54fe88f940444a88d4b03309c40c2be6424c85e6aff05ee6", "code_commit": "6c299a18e517871b834f2a6226522e7c6e6c6e40", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 2, "seed": 44}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-013", "text": "建两个页面，一个叫报警汇总，一个叫报表，都用黑底，顺便把报表页大小设成4K", "complexity": "medium", "domain": "page"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-16T04:50:06.443Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-16T04:51:15.516Z", "total_turns": 7, "terminal_state": "UNKNOWN", "early_terminated": true, "termination_reason": "no finish() call"}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T04:50:06.443Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T04:50:15.528Z"}, {"name": "CONFIG_ALARM", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T04:50:15.528Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T04:50:23.213Z"}, {"name": "MANAGE_PAGES", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T04:50:23.213Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T04:50:31.552Z"}, {"name": "CONFIG_ALARM", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T04:50:31.552Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T04:51:13.991Z"}, {"name": "MANAGE_PAGES", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T04:51:13.991Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T04:51:15.516Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["list_pages"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_pages", "action": "list_pages", "args": {"action": "list_pages"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "pages": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 1.4262999993661651, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 3, "state": "MANAGE_PAGES", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_alarms", "allowed_actions": ["disable_alarm", "enable_alarm", "delete_alarm", "create_digital_alarm", "create_analog_alarm"]}], "visible_count": 1, "selecte