alarm操作。需要指定id、tag、high_limit、low_limit、priority和deadband。用户没有指定deadband，可以设为默认值0。需要为HH和LL分别创建报警吗？还是创建一个报警，同时包含high_limit和low_limit？用户说\"分别设置HH alarm和LL alarm\"，这意味着两个独立的报警。但create_analog_alarm可以同时设置high_limit和low_limit。通常SCADA系统中，HH和LL可以是同一个报警定义的两个限值。但用户明确要求\"分别设置\"，所以最好创建两个独立的报警：一个HH报警，high_limit=100；一个LL报警，low_limit=10。优先级都是high。\n\n我需要为每个报警创建一个唯一的id。例如，HH报警可以用\"alarm_TI201_HH\"，LL报警用\"alarm_TI201_LL\"。现在调用工具。首先创建HH报警。"}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2171, "output_tokens": 117, "latency_ms": 3173.0876999999964, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "我需要修复low_limit参数。应该使用null而不是\"None\"。让我重新调用。"}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2362, "output_tokens": 118, "latency_ms": 2854.6582999997554, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "The schema says low_limit can be a number or null. I need to pass actual null, not the string \"None\". Let me try again without specifying low_limit at all since it defaults to null."}, {"turn": 5, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2552, "output_tokens": 120, "latency_ms": 4340.1187999998, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "The tool is having issues with the low_limit parameter. Let me try explicitly setting it to null using JSON syntax."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 5, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "AlarmConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 9790, "output_tokens": 842, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 22235.628599999472}, "judge": null}
