soning": "The user wants to configure alarms for a point called \"TI-201\". Specifically:\n- HH (High-High) alarm at 100\n- LL (Low-Low) alarm at 10\n- Both with high priority\n\nI need to first discover what points exist in the system. Let me list the points to see if TI-201 exists and what type it is. This aligns with the current workflow step \"discover_points\".\n\nLet me call manage_points to list points and find TI-201."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 5, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "AlarmConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 974, "output_tokens": 158, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 6920.007199999418}, "judge": null}
