{"trace_id": "3ecbfa53-af21-4fdf-94a6-ecfd7df827d0", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:17072e90aec915fe54fe88f940444a88d4b03309c40c2be6424c85e6aff05ee6", "code_commit": "6c299a18e517871b834f2a6226522e7c6e6c6e40", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 1, "seed": 43}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-014", "text": "加三个IO点: TI-201, PI-201, FI-201, 全是AI，带历史", "complexity": "medium", "domain": "point"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-16T04:52:24.654Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-16T04:52:47.948Z", "total_turns": 3, "terminal_state": "CONFIG_HISTORY", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T04:52:24.654Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T04:52:34.705Z"}, {"name": "CONFIG_HISTORY", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T04:52:34.705Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T04:52:47.948Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_history", "allowed_actions": ["list_history"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_points", "action": "list_points", "args": {"action": "list_points", "type_filter": "analog"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "points": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.9112999996432336, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 2, "state": "CONFIG_HISTORY", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_history", "allowed_actions": ["enable_history", "list_history", "set_retention"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_history", "action": "list_history", "args": {"action": "list_history", "enabled_only": "False"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "histories": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 1.4919999994162936, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 989, "output_tokens": 348, "latency_ms": 10047.709599999507, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户想要添加三个IO点：TI-201、PI-201、FI-201，都是AI类型，并且要带历史记录。当前阶段是ANALYZE_INTENT，可用工具只有manage_history和manage_points（只能列出）。要创建点，需要调用manage_points，但当前只允许list_points操作，不允许创建。根据行为准则第5条，如果当前阶段的可用工具不满足需求，可以在回复的纯文本中包含\"next_state: 阶段名\"来切换到合适的阶段。这里应该切换到CONFIG_POINT阶段，因为那是配置点的阶段。我需要先分析用户意图，然后告知需要切换阶段。不过，在切换之前，也许应该先检查一下现有的点，看看是否已经存在这些点。可以调用manage_points的list_points来查看。但用户明确要求\"加三个IO点\"，所以主要意图是创建。当前工具不允许创建，所以必须切换阶段。我应该用纯文本回复，说明需要切换到CONFIG_POINT阶段。然后包含\"next_state: CONFIG_POINT\"。同时，也可以先列出点，看看现状，但这不是必须的。根据行为准则，信息不足时可以先调用查询类工具。这里的信息是充足的：用户提供了点名和类型。但为了全面了解，可以先调用list_points。这并不妨碍切换阶段。那么，先调用manage_points list_points，然后在回复中说明需要切换阶段。现在开始执行。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1744, "output_tokens": 357, "latency_ms": 7910.756600000241, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "我需要理解当前的情况。用户要求添加三个AI点（TI-201, PI-201, FI-201），并且要带历史记录。我现在处于CONFIG_HISTORY阶段，可用工具只有manage_history和manage_points（但manage_points只允许list_points操作）。用户想要添加点，但当前阶段无法创建点。根据行为准则，如果当前阶段的可用工具不满足需求，我应该在回复的纯文本中包含\"next_state: 阶段名\"来切换到合适的阶段。用户要求添加点，这需要CONFIG_POINT阶段。但用户也提到\"带历史\"，这意味着在创建点后，还需要启用历史记录。不过，首先要创建点。当前阶段是CONFIG_HISTORY，但创建点需要CONFIG_POINT阶段。我应该先切换到CONFIG_POINT阶段来创建点，然后再回到CONFIG_HISTORY阶段启用历史记录。或者，我可以在当前阶段先检查历史记录配置，但点还不存在。让我先尝试使用manage_history的list_history来看看当前配置，但这可能对创建点没有帮助。不过，根据工作流上下文：当前workflow=HistoryQuery, step=enable_history_if_missing。这表明当前工作流是关于历史查询的，步骤是\"如果缺少历史记录则启用\"。用户要求添加点并启用历史记录，这可能需要先创建点，然后启用历史。但当前阶段无法创建点。我应该切换到CONFIG_POINT阶段。让我先调用manage_history的list_history来了解当前历史配置状态。然后根据情况决定下一步。"}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1760, "output_tokens": 224, "latency_ms": 5324.434299999666, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "您需要先创建这三个AI点(TI-201, PI-201, FI-201)，然后才能配置历史记录。当前CONFIG_HISTORY阶段只能管理历史配置，无法创建点位。请先切换到CONFIG_POINT阶段创建这些点。\n\nnext_state: CONFIG_POINT", "reasoning": "当前处于CONFIG_HISTORY阶段，可用工具只有manage_history，而且只能执行list_history和query_history操作。用户的需求是添加三个AI点（TI-201, PI-201, FI-201）并带历史记录。但在这个阶段，无法直接创建点，只能管理历史配置。需要先切换到CONFIG_POINT阶段来创建点，然后再回到CONFIG_HISTORY阶段启用历史记录。不过，根据行为准则，如果当前阶段的可用工具不满足需求，可以在回复的纯文本中包含\"next_state: 阶段名\"来切换到合适的阶段。所以，我应该先切换到CONFIG_POINT阶段。在切换之前，需要明确告知用户原因。回复应该包含切换指令和说明。现在生成回复。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 5, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "HistoryQuery"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 4493, "output_tokens": 929, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 23294.658900000286}, "judge": null}
