k if the point \"TI-201\" exists in the system. Let me list the points to verify this."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1743, "output_tokens": 226, "latency_ms": 6067.749400000139, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "TI-201 确认存在，现在为它设置 HH（高高）和 LL（低低）报警。", "reasoning": "用户确认了 TI-201 这个模拟量点位存在，现在需要为它设置 HH 和 LL 报警。我将调用 manage_alarms 工具分别创建 HH 和 LL 报警。"}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2059, "output_tokens": 225, "latency_ms": 4775.122299999566, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "两个报警已成功创建，配置如下：\n\n| 报警 ID | 监测点位 | 类型 | 阈值 | 优先级 |\n|---------|---------|------|------|--------|\n| TI-201_HH | TI-201 | 高高限 (HH) | 100 | high |\n| TI-201_LL | TI-201 | 低低限 (LL) | 10 | high |\n\n**说明：**\n- 当 TI-201 的值 **≥ 100** 时，触发 HH 报警\n- 当 TI-201 的值 **≤ 10** 时，触发 LL 报警\n- 两个报警均为 **高优先级 (high)**\n\n如需调整阈值或死区（deadband），可以告诉我继续修改。如果报警配置已完成，请告诉我下一步操作。", "reasoning": "The user seems to be repeating the stage information. The alarms have already been created successfully. Let me summarize what was done for the user."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 5, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "AlarmConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 4776, "output_tokens": 584, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 15861.652399999912}, "judge": null}
