{"trace_id": "e571bb11-cdac-4ffb-86c3-f391a946455f", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:17072e90aec915fe54fe88f940444a88d4b03309c40c2be6424c85e6aff05ee6", "code_commit": "6c299a18e517871b834f2a6226522e7c6e6c6e40", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 2, "seed": 44}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-018", "text": "新建全局脚本，OnEvent触发，写一段逻辑如果PI-201过高则把valve1置位", "complexity": "medium", "domain": "script"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-16T04:57:26.217Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-16T04:57:59.732Z", "total_turns": 4, "terminal_state": "UNKNOWN", "early_terminated": true, "termination_reason": "no finish() call"}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T04:57:26.217Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T04:57:39.753Z"}, {"name": "CONFIG_SCRIPT", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T04:57:39.753Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T04:57:59.732Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_scripts", "allowed_actions": ["list_scripts"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_scripts", "action": "list_scripts", "args": {"action": "list_scripts"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "scripts": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.8367999998881714, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_scripts", "allowed_actions": ["list_scripts"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_points", "action": "list_points", "args": {"action": "list_points"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 2, "points": [{"tag": "PI-201", "type": "analog", "unit": null, "min": null, "max": null, "description": null}, {"tag": "valve1", "type": "digital", "unit": null, "min": null, "max": null, "description": null}]}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.6631999995079241, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 1, "state": "VALIDATE", "visible_tools": [], "visible_count": 0, "selected": "workflow:handlers.validate_project", "action": null, "args": {}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"ok": true, "checked_at": "validate_project"}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.0038999996831989847, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 3, "state": "CONFIG_SCRIPT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_scripts", "allowed_actions": ["create_script", "update_script_body", "list_scripts", "delete_script", "disable_script"]}], "visible_count": 1, "selected": "manage_scripts", "action": "create_script", "args": {"action": "create_script", "id": "PI201_High_Valve1_Control", "name": "PI-201 High Pressure Valve Control", "trigger": "on_event", "bound_tag": "PI-201", "body": "// 当PI-201压力过高时，自动打开valve1进行泄压\nconst currentPressure = getTagValue('PI-201');\nconst highThreshold = 100; // 高压阈值\n\nif (currentPressure > highThreshold) {\n    setTagValue('valve1', true); // 置位valve1（打开阀门）\n    logEvent('PI-201压力过高(' + currentPressure + ')，已自动打开valve1');\n} else {\n    // 可选：当压力恢复正常时关闭阀门\n    // setTagValue('valve1', false);\n}"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"script_id": "PI201_High_Valve1_Control"}, "world_diff": {"added_or_modified": {"scripts.PI201_High_Valve1_Control": {"id": "PI201_High_Valve1_Control", "name": "PI-201 High Pressure Valve Control", "trigger": "on_event", "bound_tag": "PI-201", "period_s": null, "body": "// 当PI-201压力过高时，自动打开valve1进行泄压\nconst currentPressure = getTagValue('PI-201');\nconst highThreshold = 100; // 高压阈值\n\nif (currentPressure > highThreshold) {\n    setTagValue('valve1', true); // 置位valve1（打开阀门）\n    logEvent('PI-201压力过高(' + currentPressure + ')，已自动打开valve1');\n} else {\n    // 可选：当压力恢复正常时关闭阀门\n    // setTagValue('valve1', false);\n}", "enabled": true}}, "removed": []}, "latency_ms": 0.9595999999874039, "intended_entities": ["scripts.PI201_High_Valve1_Control"], "referenced_entities": ["points.PI-201"]}, {"turn": 4, "state": "CONFIG_SCRIPT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_scripts", "allowed_actions": ["create_script", "update_script_body", "list_scripts", "delete_script", "disable_script"]}], "visible_count": 1, "selected": "manage_scripts", "action": "list_scripts", "args": {"action": "list_scripts"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 1, "scripts": [{"id": "PI201_High_Valve1_Control", "name": "PI-201 High Pressure Valve Control", "trigger": "on_event", "bound_tag": "PI-201", "period_s": null, "body": "// 当PI-201压力过高时，自动打开valve1进行泄压\nconst currentPressure = getTagValue('PI-201');\nconst highThreshold = 100; // 高压阈值\n\nif (currentPressure > highThreshold) {\n    setTagValue('valve1', true); // 置位valve1（打开阀门）\n    logEvent('PI-201压力过高(' + currentPressure + ')，已自动打开valve1');\n} else {\n    // 可选：当压力恢复正常时关闭阀门\n    // setTagValue('valve1', false);\n}", "enabled": true}]}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.8354000001418171, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:d88107776650cb454d9d573d07babb192ac66fb7faa1784b2aff648b26102014", "final_hash": null, "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1024, "output_tokens": 163, "latency_ms": 3965.007899999364, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户想要创建一个新的全局脚本，触发条件是 OnEvent，逻辑是：如果 PI-201 过高，则将 valve1 置位。\n\n当前阶段是 ANALYZE_INTENT。可用的工具有 manage_scripts 和 manage_points，但 manage_scripts 目前只允许 list_scripts 操作，manage_points 只允许 list_points 操作。这意味着我无法直接创建脚本或点位。\n\n不过，我可以先查看现有的脚本和点位，以便为用户提供更准确的建议。让我先调用这两个查询工具。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1660, "output_tokens": 475, "latency_ms": 9563.181100000293, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "我了解您想创建一个全局脚本，逻辑如下：\n- 触发条件：OnEvent\n- 逻辑：当 PI-201 值过高时，将 valve1 置位\n\n首先，我需要确认几个细节：\n1. **\"PI-201过高\"的阈值是多少？** 例如，当 PI-201 > 100 时？\n2. **\"把valve1置位\"具体是什么操作？** 是将 valve1 设置为 ON（1）吗？还是其他操作？\n\n另外，我查看了当前系统状态：\n- 目前已有 PI-201（模拟量）和 valve1（数字量）这两个点位，这很好。\n- 目前没有定义任何脚本。\n\n确认这些信息后，我可以帮您创建相应的脚本。由于当前阶段的工具限制，我需要切换到 CONFIG_SCRIPT 阶段来完成脚本配置。\n\nnext_state: CONFIG_SCRIPT", "reasoning": "我看到目前没有脚本，但有两个点位：PI-201（模拟量）和 valve1（数字量）。这正好符合用户的需求。用户想要创建一个 OnEvent 触发的脚本。然而，当前阶段是 ANALYZE_INTENT，可用的工具只有 list_scripts 和 list_points，这意味着我无法直接创建脚本。\n\n根据行为准则第5条：如果当前阶段的可用工具不满足需求，可以在回复的纯文本中包含 \"next_state: 阶段名\" 来切换到【可切换的下一阶段】中的合适阶段。\n\n那么，我应该切换到哪个阶段呢？用户需要创建脚本，这对应的是 SCRIPT_CONFIG 阶段。让我看看下一阶段列表：ASK_USER, BIND_POINTS, CONFIG_ALARM, CONFIG_HISTORY, CONFIG_POINT, CONFIG_SCRIPT, DEPLOY, DONE, GENERATE_LAYOUT, MANAGE_PAGES, VALIDATE。其中 CONFIG_SCRIPT 看起来是最合适的。\n\n不过，在切换之前，我应该先询问用户一些细节，比如\"PI-201过高\"具体是什么阈值？是大于某个值吗？还有，\"把valve1置位\"是什么意思？是设置为1（开）吗？让我先向用户确认这些细节。"}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2130, "output_tokens": 557, "latency_ms": 12919.415900000786, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户已进入 CONFIG_SCRIPT 阶段，我需要使用 manage_scripts 工具来创建脚本。但用户还没有回答我关于阈值和置位操作的具体问题。让我再看看用户的需求：新建全局脚本，OnEvent触发，写一段逻辑如果PI-201过高则把valve1置位。\n\n我需要知道\"过高\"的阈值。我可以假设一个合理的默认值，比如 PI-201 > 100，但最好还是确认一下。不过，既然用户说\"请使用当前可用工具继续完成任务\"，他们可能希望我直接创建脚本，使用合理的默认值。\n\n让我创建脚本。首先需要生成一个脚本ID。我会创建一个OnEvent触发的脚本，名称可以叫\"PI201_High_Valve1_Control\"。脚本体应该检查 PI-201 的值，如果过高则将 valve1 设为 ON。\n\n在SCADA系统中，OnEvent触发通常由某个事件触发，比如某个点位的值变化。这里可能是 PI-201 的值变化触发的。我需要将脚本绑定到 PI-201 吗？OnEvent触发可能需要一个绑定的点位。让我创建脚本，将 bound_tag 设为 \"PI-201\"。\n\n脚本体应该是类似这样的伪代码：\nif (PI-201 > 100) {\n    valve1 = 1; // 置位\n}\n\n我需要用合理的语法。让我假设使用 JavaScript 语法。现在开始创建脚本。"}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2751, "output_tokens": 239, "latency_ms": 5514.74109999981, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户提示我已经进入了CONFIG_SCRIPT阶段。根据之前的对话，我已经创建了一个脚本。现在用户又发了一条消息，说\"你已进入 CONFIG_SCRIPT 阶段，请使用当前可用工具继续完成任务。\" 这可能是系统自动发送的提示消息，表示我现在在CONFIG_SCRIPT阶段，可以使用manage_scripts工具。\n\n回顾一下上下文：用户最初想要创建一个全局脚本，OnEvent触发，逻辑是如果PI-201过高则把valve1置位。我已经创建了一个脚本，ID是\"PI201_High_Valve1_Control\"，使用了on_event触发器，绑定了PI-201，脚本体中设置了阈值100，当PI-201超过100时将valve1设为true。\n\n现在用户可能想要我继续验证或修改脚本。我可以使用manage_scripts工具来查看已创建的脚本，或者进行其他操作。让我先列出所有脚本，确认脚本已创建。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 5, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "ScriptConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 7565, "output_tokens": 1434, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 33514.70809999955}, "judge": null}
