ntities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 2, "state": "BIND_POINTS", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["bind_point", "list_pages"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_points", "action": "list_points", "args": {"action": "list_points", "type_filter": "None"}, "schema_valid": false, "result_ok": false, "error_code": "SCHEMA_ERROR", "error_msg": "list_points.type_filter: Input should be 'analog', 'digital' or 'string'", "result_data": {}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.8969999998953426, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 3, "state": "BIND_POINTS", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["bind_point", "list_pages"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_points", "action": "list_points", "args": {"action": "list_points"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 2, "points": [{"tag": "PumpA", "type": "digital", "unit": null, "min": null, "max": null, "description": null}, {"tag": "PumpB", "type": "digital", "unit": null, "min": null, "max": null, "description": null}]}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.7806000003256486, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 3, "state": "VALIDATE", "visible_tools": [], "visible_count": 0, "selected": "workflow:handlers.validate_project", "action": null, "args": {}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"ok": true, "checked_at": "validate_project"}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.0037999998312443495, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:98327752e448e2768a1d5554e14583a307747a19d68f8b9f81b75d5bd3482296", "final_hash": null, "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 969, "output_tokens": 456, "latency_ms": 12928.462200000467, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户想要新建一个泵站画面，添加2个泵图元，分别绑定PumpA和PumpB点位。这涉及到页面管理和点位绑定。\n\n当前阶段是ANALYZE_INTENT，我需要分析用户意图。用户的需求可以分解为：\n1. 新建一个页面（泵站画面）\n2. 在该页面上添加2个泵图元\n3. 将图元分别绑定到PumpA和PumpB点位\n\n当前可用工具：\n- manage_pages：用于HMI页面和图元管理，包括点位与图元的绑定。当前允许的actions只有list_pages。\n- manage_points：用于创建/更新/删除/列出SCADA点位。当前允许的actions只有list_points。\n\n从可用工具来看，manage_pages的list_pages只能列出页面，无法创建页面或添加图元。manage_points的list_points只能列出点位，无法创建点位。这显然无法满足用户新建页面和绑定点位的需求。\n\n根据行为准则第5点：若当前阶段的可用工具不满足需求，我可以在回复的纯文本中包含\"next_state: 阶段名\"来切换到【可切换的下一阶段】中的合适阶段。\n\n可切换的下一阶段包括：ASK_USER, BIND_POINTS, CONFIG_ALARM, CONFIG_HISTORY, CONFIG_POINT, CONFIG_SCRIPT, DEPLOY, DONE, GENERATE_LAYOUT, MANAGE_PAGES, VALIDATE。\n\n这里涉及到页面管理和点位绑定，MANAGE_PAGES和BIND_POINTS应该是相关的。但首先，我需要确认点位是否存在。用户提到了PumpA和PumpB点位，我需要先检查这些点位是否存在。我可以使用manage_points工具来列出点位，看看是否包含PumpA和PumpB。\n\n另外，我也需要查看当前有哪些页面，虽然这不会直接解决问题，但可以了解现状。\n\n让我先调用这两个工具来收集信息。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1709, "output_tokens": 274, "latency_ms": 8114.164900000105, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户希望创建泵站画面并绑定点位。现在处于BIND_POINTS阶段，但当前可用工具只有manage_pages和manage_points。manage_pages只能绑定点位到图元和列出页面，不能创建页面或添加图元。manage_points只能列出点位。\n\n用户要\"新建泵站画面\"，这需要创建页面。但当前工具不支持创建页面。根据行为准则第5点，如果当前阶段的工具不满足需求，可以在回复中包含\"next_state: 阶段名\"来切换到下一阶段。可切换的下一阶段包括MANAGE_PAGES。这应该是更合适的阶段，可能支持创建页面。\n\n另外，用户要\"添加2个泵图元\"，这也需要页面管理功能。还要\"分别绑定PumpA和PumpB点位\"，这需要点位存在。我刚才调用list_points时出错了，因为type_filter参数格式不对。让我再试一次，不带过滤器或正确使用null。\n\n先获取点位列表，确认PumpA和PumpB是否存在。然后考虑切换到MANAGE_PAGES阶段。用manage_points列出所有点位。"}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2055, "output_tokens": 192, "latency_ms": 5687.0900999992955, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户重复了之前的提示。我需要再次尝试调用manage_points。根据错误信息，type_filter应该是一个枚举值或null，但schema显示anyOf包含enum和null，可能需要传递null而不应该是None。让我尝试不传递type_filter参数，或者明确传递null。先看看schema：anyOf: [{\"enum\": [\"analog\", \"digital\", \"string\"], \"type\": \"string\"}, {\"type\": \"null\"}]，说明可以是字符串或null。默认值是null。我可以尝试不传递这个参数，或者显式传递null。让我尝试不传递type_filter。但schema显示它是可选的吗？实际上在properties中定义了type_filter，但required数组中只有action，所以type_filter是可选的。我可以不传递它。试试看。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 5, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "PointBinding"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 4733, "output_tokens": 922, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 28158.48939999978}, "judge": null}
