{"trace_id": "9e3dc7ef-611b-4288-9bd3-37071b09402e", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:17072e90aec915fe54fe88f940444a88d4b03309c40c2be6424c85e6aff05ee6", "code_commit": "6c299a18e517871b834f2a6226522e7c6e6c6e40", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 2, "seed": 44}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-018", "text": "新建全局脚本，OnEvent触发，写一段逻辑如果PI-201过高则把valve1置位", "complexity": "medium", "domain": "script"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-16T04:58:16.069Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-16T04:58:35.447Z", "total_turns": 2, "terminal_state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T04:58:16.069Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T04:58:35.447Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_scripts", "allowed_actions": ["list_scripts"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_points", "action": "list_points", "args": {"action": "list_points"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 2, "points": [{"tag": "PI-201", "type": "analog", "unit": null, "min": null, "max": null, "description": null}, {"tag": "valve1", "type": "digital", "unit": null, "min": null, "max": null, "description": null}]}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.7869000000937376, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_scripts", "allowed_actions": ["list_scripts"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_scripts", "action": "list_scripts", "args": {"action": "list_scripts"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "scripts": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.7068000004437636, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 1, "state": "VALIDATE", "visible_tools": [], "visible_count": 0, "selected": "workflow:handlers.validate_project", "action": null, "args": {}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"ok": true, "checked_at": "validate_project"}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.003499999365885742, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:d88107776650cb454d9d573d07babb192ac66fb7faa1784b2aff648b26102014", "final_hash": "sha256:d88107776650cb454d9d573d07babb192ac66fb7faa1784b2aff648b26102014", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1024, "output_tokens": 366, "latency_ms": 8942.55239999984, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我来帮你配置这个脚本。首先，让我检查一下项目中现有的点位和脚本情况，确认 PI-201 和 valve1 是否已存在。", "reasoning": "The user wants to create a new global script with an OnEvent trigger. The script logic should: if PI-201 is too high, then set valve1.\n\nBefore I can create the script, I need to understand the current state of the project. Let me first check:\n1. What scripts already exist (to avoid conflicts)\n2. What points are available (to verify PI-201 and valve1 exist)\n\nHowever, looking at the available tools, I can only `list_scripts` and `list_points` - I don't have a tool to CREATE scripts. The manage_scripts tool currently only allows `list_scripts` action.\n\nLet me first query the existing points and scripts to understand the context, then inform the user about what I found and what steps are needed.\n\nActually, let me re-read the context:\n- Current stage: ANALYZE_INTENT\n- Current workflow: ScriptConfig, step: pick_binding\n- Available actions for manage_scripts: list_scripts only\n- Available actions for manage_points: list_points only\n\nI don't have the ability to CREATE scripts in the current stage. I should first check if the points exist, and then figure out how to proceed. Since I can't create scripts directly with the current tools, I may need to switch to a different stage.\n\nLet me first list the points and scripts to gather information, then guide the user."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1863, "output_tokens": 419, "latency_ms": 10426.456199999848, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "✅ 点位检查完成：\n| 点位 | 类型 | 状态 |\n|------|------|------|\n| **PI-201** | 模拟量 (analog) | ✅ 已存在 |\n| **valve1** | 数字量 (digital) | ✅ 已存在 |\n\n✅ 当前项目中尚无已定义的脚本。\n\n---\n\n在创建脚本之前，我需要确认几个细节：\n\n1. **\"过高\"的阈值是多少？** 例如：`PI-201 > 100` 视为过高？请提供具体的数值。\n2. **脚本命名**：建议命名为 `pi201_high_protect`，可以吗？\n3. **触发事件类型**：`on_event` 需要指定具体事件源，还是你更希望使用 `on_change`（PI-201 值变化时触发）或 `periodic`（周期检测）？\n\n> 💡 **建议**：对于\"检测某模拟量是否过高并联动开关\"这类逻辑，通常使用 `on_change` 或 `periodic` 触发更为常见，能确保及时响应。请确认你的偏好。", "reasoning": "Good news:\n1. Both PI-201 (analog point) and valve1 (digital point) already exist in the project\n2. There are currently no scripts defined\n\nThe user wants to create a new script:\n- Trigger: on_event\n- Logic: If PI-201 is too high (过高), set valve1 to 1 (置位)\n\nI need to think about what \"过高\" means - this would typically require a threshold value. I should ask the user for the threshold value.\n\nAlso, I need to determine what information is missing:\n- Script id and name (I can suggest these)\n- The threshold value for \"过高\" (I need to ask)\n- The script body\n\nLet me ask the user for the threshold before proceeding."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 5, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "ScriptConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 2887, "output_tokens": 785, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 19377.026500000284}, "judge": null}
