true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"deployment_id": "default", "status": "draft", "errors": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 1.1610999990807613, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": ["deployments.default"]}, {"turn": 2, "state": "VALIDATE", "visible_tools": [{"name": "deployment", "allowed_actions": ["deploy_project", "show_deployment_status", "validate_project", "rollback_deployment"]}], "visible_count": 1, "selected": "deployment", "action": "validate_project", "args": {"action": "validate_project"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"deployment_id": "default", "errors": [], "status": "validated"}, "world_diff": {"added_or_modified": {"deployments.default": {"id": "default", "target": "default", "status": "validated", "validation_errors": [], "notes": ""}}, "removed": []}, "latency_ms": 1.393399999869871, "intended_entities": ["deployments.default"], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:a8b38ccbde7608389b905237a2c359bf6459a8a493f163a10a476a380590948e", "final_hash": "sha256:f4c1b6d5cc89f00171093fd26daf8088fe4803a78b0922514df6e54a6ca08699", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1424, "output_tokens": 401, "latency_ms": 8793.687199999113, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我来分析一下你的需求：\n\n1. **复制页面** — 从车间一复制到车间二\n2. **替换点位标签** — 将所有 'WS1' 替换为 'WS2'\n3. **下装前校验** — 运行项目一致性检查\n\n让我先查看当前的页面列表和项目状态，确认现有配置：", "reasoning": "The user is asking me to:\n1. Copy a page from \"车间一\" (Workshop 1) to \"车间二\" (Workshop 2)\n2. Replace all 'WS1' point tags with 'WS2' in the copied page\n3. Run pre-deployment validation\n\nLet me analyze what tools I have available:\n- `manage_pages`: Only supports `list_pages` action currently - cannot copy pages or modify widgets\n- `deployment`: Supports `show_deployment_status` and `validate_project` - can do validation\n- `manage_history`: Only supports `list_history` - not relevant\n- `manage_points`: Only supports `list_points` - not relevant\n\nThe current stage is VALIDATE, and the available tools don't include capabilities to:\n1. Copy pages\n2. Modify widget bindings (replace point tags)\n\nThe `manage_pages` tool description says it handles \"point↔widget binding\" but the only allowed action is `list_pages`. I cannot copy pages or replace point bindings with the current tools.\n\nLet me first check what pages exist by listing them, and then I can inform the user about the limitations. I can at least run the validation check.\n\nLet me list the pages first to understand the current state, and also run the validation since that's what the user wants as the final step."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1648, "output_tokens": 485, "latency_ms": 10732.65050000009, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "根据当前查询结果，情况如下：\n\n### 当前状态\n- **现有页面**：车间一 (id: `ws1`) \n- **项目状态**：草稿阶段 (draft)，无校验错误\n\n### ⚠️ 能力限制说明\n\n很抱歉，当前阶段（VALIDATE）的可用工具**无法完成页面复制和点位标签替换**的操作：\n\n| 需求 | 可用工具 | 是否支持 |\n|------|---------|---------|\n| 复制页面到车间二 | `manage_pages` 仅支持 `list_pages` | ❌ 不支持 |\n| 替换 WS1→WS2 点位标签 | 无编辑 widget 绑定的工具 | ❌ 不支持 |\n| 下装前校验 | `deployment` → `validate_project` | ✅ 支持 |\n\n---\n\n### 我可以立即为你做的：\n\n先执行**下装前校验**，确认当前项目的一致性：", "reasoning": "So I can see:\n- There's 1 page: \"车间一\" (id: ws1)\n- The deployment status is \"draft\" with no errors\n\nNow the user wants to:\n1. Copy this page to create a \"车间二\" page\n2. Replace WS1 tags with WS2\n3. Run validation\n\nUnfortunately, I don't have tools to:\n- Copy a page\n- Modify widget bindings/point references\n\nThe `manage_pages` tool only supports `list_pages` action currently. I cannot copy pages or replace point bindings.\n\nI need to inform the user that:\n1. The page copy and point tag replacement operations are not available with the current tools\n2. But I CAN run the validation check\n\nLet me explain this to the user and offer to run the validation. I should also suggest that if they need to perform the page copy and tag replacement, they may need to switch to a different stage or use different tools.\n\nActually, looking at the available stages: \"可切换的下一阶段：ANALYZE_INTENT, DEPLOY, DONE\"\n\nNone of these stages seem to have page editing capabilities either. Let me be honest with the user about what I can and cannot do with the current toolset."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2177, "output_tokens": 201, "latency_ms": 5014.777700000195, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "### ✅ 校验结果\n\n```\n项目校验通过，无错误。\n- 部署ID: default\n- 状态: draft\n- 错误数: 0\n```\n\n---\n\n### 关于页面复制和点位替换\n\n要完成\"**复制车间一页面到车间二，并将 WS1 替换为 WS2**\"这个需求，需要页面编辑类工具（如创建页面、编辑 widget 绑定等），但当前阶段不提供这些功能。\n\n**建议你**：\n1. 在 SCADA 配置界面中手动复制页面，或\n2. 告诉我进入 **ANALYZE_INTENT** 阶段，我会重新分析是否有其他途径完成该操作\n\n需要我切换到其他阶段来尝试处理页面复制和点位替换的需求吗？", "reasoning": "The validation passed with no errors. Now I should inform the user about the results and explain the limitations clearly."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 5, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "DeploymentCheck"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 5249, "output_tokens": 1087, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 24562.83059999987}, "judge": null}
