": null, "result_data": {"deployment_id": "default", "status": "draft", "errors": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 2.0189999995636754, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": ["deployments.default"]}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:a8b38ccbde7608389b905237a2c359bf6459a8a493f163a10a476a380590948e", "final_hash": null, "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1424, "output_tokens": 153, "latency_ms": 3188.5378999995737, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户的需求是：\n1. 复制\"车间一\"的页面到\"车间二\"\n2. 替换所有'WS1'点位标签为'WS2'\n3. 做下装前校验\n\n当前阶段是 VALIDATE，可用工具只有：\n- manage_pages: 只能 list_pages\n- deployment: 可以 show_deployment_status, validate_project\n- manage_history: 只能 list_history\n- manage_points: 只能 list_points\n\n首先，我需要了解当前有哪些页面，以便找到\"车间一\"的页面。让我先调用 list_pages。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1378, "output_tokens": 203, "latency_ms": 4796.785700000328, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户想复制车间一的页面到车间二，替换所有'WS1'点位标签为'WS2'，然后做下装前校验。不过，现在系统提示我已进入 DEPLOY 阶段，并且当前可用工具只有 deployment 这一个。在 DEPLOY 阶段，可用的 actions 包括 deploy_project, show_deployment_status, validate_project, rollback_deployment。\n\n然而，用户的需求涉及页面复制和点位标签替换，这些操作在 DEPLOY 阶段可能无法直接完成，因为 manage_pages 和 manage_points 工具在当前阶段不可用。但用户坚持要我继续完成任务。我需要先检查当前的部署状态，然后看看能否进行校验。\n\n首先，我需要查看当前的部署状态。使用 deployment 工具的 show_deployment_status action。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 5, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "DeploymentCheck"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 2802, "output_tokens": 356, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 9377.64850000167}, "judge": null}
