 1.3584000007540453, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 4, "state": "ASK_USER", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_alarms", "allowed_actions": ["disable_alarm", "delete_alarm", "enable_alarm", "create_digital_alarm"]}, {"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["create_page"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_pages", "action": "list_pages", "args": {"action": "list_pages"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "pages": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 1.2437000004865695, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 967, "output_tokens": 305, "latency_ms": 7507.500200001232, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户想要创建一个泵站控制台，包含启停控制功能，并且需要配置报警。当前阶段是ANALYZE_INTENT，可用工具只有manage_points和manage_pages的list操作。\n\n首先，我需要理解用户的需求：\n1. 创建一个泵站控制台（HMI页面）\n2. 包含启停控制功能（可能需要按钮、指示灯等控件）\n3. 配置报警功能\n\n但目前可用的工具只能列出点和页面，不能创建或配置。因此我需要切换到合适的阶段来完成这些任务。\n\n根据【可切换的下一阶段】，我有几个选项：\n- ASK_USER：向用户询问更多信息\n- BIND_POINTS：绑定点位\n- CONFIG_ALARM：配置报警\n- CONFIG_HISTORY：配置历史记录\n- CONFIG_POINT：配置点位\n- CONFIG_SCRIPT：配置脚本\n- DEPLOY：部署\n- DONE：完成\n- GENERATE_LAYOUT：生成布局\n- MANAGE_PAGES：管理页面\n- VALIDATE：验证\n\n由于用户需要创建控制台和配置报警，我需要先了解当前项目中有哪些点和页面。所以先调用list工具获取信息。\n\n让我先列出所有点和页面，了解当前项目状态。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1766, "output_tokens": 269, "latency_ms": 8107.403899999554, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "当前项目中没有点位和页面，这是一个全新的项目。用户需要创建泵站控制台，包含启停控制和报警。\n\n我需要向用户询问一些关键信息：\n1. 泵站的点位信息：启停控制点（输出点）、状态反馈点（输入点）、报警点等\n2. 控制台的布局和设计需求\n3. 报警的具体类型和条件\n\n让我进入ASK_USER阶段来收集更多信息。根据行为准则，我可以在回复的纯文本中包含\"next_state: ASK_USER\"来切换阶段。\n\n我需要询问：\n1. 泵站有多少台泵？每台泵需要哪些点位？\n2. 控制台需要哪些界面元素？（启动按钮、停止按钮、状态指示灯、报警指示等）\n3. 报警的类型：是离散报警（如故障报警）还是模拟量报警（如压力高报警）？\n4. 报警的优先级要求？\n\n我会在回复中明确说明需要用户提供的信息，然后切换到ASK_USER阶段。"}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2102, "output_tokens": 221, "latency_ms": 5973.384199998691, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "我需要了解更多关于您的泵站控制台的需求。请告诉我：\n\n1. **泵站规模**：有几台泵？每台泵的名称/编号？\n2. **点位需求**：每台泵需要哪些控制/状态点位？\n   - 启动输出（DO）\n   - 停止输出（DO）\n   - 运行状态反馈（DI）\n   - 故障信号（DI）\n   - 其他（如电流、压力等模拟量）\n3. **报警需求**：需要哪些报警？\n   - 设备故障报警\n   - 参数越限报警（如压力过高/过低）\n   - 报警优先级要求\n4. **页面需求**：控制台页面的名称、分辨率偏好？\n\n请提供这些信息后，我将为您完成全套配置。\n\nnext_state: ASK_USER", "reasoning": "好的，我已经确认当前项目是空的。现在我需要与用户进一步沟通，了解具体需求。我会在回复中询问必要的信息，并切换到ASK_USER阶段。"}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2320, "output_tokens": 114, "latency_ms": 3297.8659000000334, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "我需要根据用户的请求创建泵站控制台和报警配置。但当前阶段是 ASK_USER，可用工具只有 manage_points 和 manage_pages 的 list 操作。我需要先收集更多信息，才能进入后续阶段进行配置。\n\n让我先检查一下当前项目中的点位和页面情况，以便更好地了解现有资源。"}, {"turn": 5, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2524, "output_tokens": 546, "latency_ms": 12835.678400000688, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "您好！我正在收集泵站控制台的配置需求。为了为您创建完整的控制台和报警系统，请告诉我以下信息：\n\n1. **泵站规模**：有几台泵？每台泵的名称/编号？（例如：1#泵、2#泵）\n2. **每台泵的点位需求**：\n   - 控制输出：启动（DO）、停止（DO）？\n   - 状态输入：运行状态（DI）、故障信号（DI）？\n   - 其他监测：电流、压力、温度等模拟量（AI）？\n3. **报警需求**：\n   - 设备故障报警（DI信号触发）？\n   - 参数越限报警（如压力>0.8MPa）？\n   - 报警优先级（高/中/低）？\n4. **控制台页面**：\n   - 页面名称（如\"泵站监控总貌\"）？\n   - 分辨率偏好（默认1920×1080）？\n\n请提供这些信息后，我将为您规划配置步骤并逐步实施。", "reasoning": "用户让我处于ASK_USER阶段，当前可用工具只有manage_points和manage_pages，且action只能是list。但用户之前请求的是创建泵站控制台和报警配置，这需要创建点位、页面、绑定控件和配置报警。目前阶段的工具无法完成这些操作。\n\n我需要向用户解释当前情况，并询问是否可以切换到更合适的阶段来完成任务。用户之前提到“弄个泵站的控制台，带上启停控制，全套搞定，再弄个报警”，这是一个完整的配置需求。\n\n我应该询问用户是否要切换到可以创建点位、页面和配置报警的阶段。根据【可切换的下一阶段】，有BIND_POINTS、CONFIG_ALARM、CONFIG_HISTORY、CONFIG_POINT、CONFIG_SCRIPT、DEPLOY、DONE、GENERATE_LAYOUT、MANAGE_PAGES、VALIDATE等阶段。\n\n为了完成用户的全套需求，我需要：\n1. 先配置点位（CONFIG_POINT阶段）\n2. 创建页面（MANAGE_PAGES阶段）\n3. 绑定点位到控件（BIND_POINTS阶段）\n4. 配置报警（CONFIG_ALARM阶段）\n5. 最后验证和部署\n\n但首先需要了解用户的具体需求，比如泵站有多少台泵，每台泵需要哪些控制点（启动、停止、状态、故障等），报警条件是什么。这些信息目前没有。\n\n在ASK_USER阶段，我应该向用户提问以收集必要信息。然后根据回答，建议切换到合适的阶段。\n\n让我先向用户提问收集信息。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 5, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "AlarmConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 9679, "output_tokens": 1455, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 37757.733200000075}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "db8c34a8-01dd-49cf-84ac-af07d9c0a2c6", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:17072e90aec915fe54fe88f940444a88d4b03309c40c2be6424c85e6aff05ee6", "code_commit": "6c299a18e517871b834f2a6226522e7c6e6c6e40", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 0, "seed": 42}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-030", "text": "给根本不存在的假点位配上一大堆高低报，然后再开个趋势图看它", "complexity": "complex", "domain": "multi"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-16T05:08:34.316Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-16T05:09:00.233Z", "total_turns": 2, "terminal_state": "CONFIG_HISTORY", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T05:08:34.316Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T05:08:43.426Z"}, {"name": "CONFIG_HISTORY", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T05:08:43.426Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T05:09:00.233Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_history", "allowed_actions": ["list_history"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_points", "action": "list_points", "args": {"action": "list_points"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "points": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 1.6997000002447749, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_history", "allowed_actions": ["list_history"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_history", "action": "list_history", "args": {"action": "list_history"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "histories": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 1.2206999999762047, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 978, "output_tokens": 375, "latency_ms": 9103.077100000519, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我先了解一下当前系统的实际情况，看看有哪些点位已经配置，以及历史记录的配置状态。", "reasoning": "The user is asking me to:\n1. Configure alarms (high/low) for non-existent/fake points\n2. Then open a trend chart to view them\n\nLet me analyze this request carefully:\n\n1. The user explicitly says \"根本不存在的假点位\" (completely non-existent fake points) - they want to create alarms for points that don't exist\n2. This is problematic because:\n   - Alarm configuration on non-existent points would be meaningless and could cause system errors\n   - This sounds like it could be a test or potentially a request to waste resources\n\nHowever, let me think about this more carefully. The user might be:\n- Testing the system to see how it handles such requests\n- Genuinely wanting to create some test/demo points first, then configure alarms\n\nBut the way the request is phrased - \"假点位\" (fake points) - suggests they know these points don't exist and want to proceed anyway.\n\nAccording to my guidelines:\n- I should not fabricate tools\n- I should call query tools first if information is insufficient\n- For high-risk operations, I should refuse and explain risks\n\nLet me first check what points actually exist in the system by calling list_points, and what history is configured. This will help me give an informed response.\n\nCurrently I'm in ANALYZE_INTENT stage with available tools:\n- manage_history (list_history action)\n- manage_points (list_points action)\n\nLet me query both to understand the current state before responding."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1390, "output_tokens": 685, "latency_ms": 16803.982400000677, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "## 当前系统状态\n\n根据查询结果：\n- **已配置点位：0 个**\n- **已配置历史记录：0 条**\n\n## 无法执行该请求\n\n抱歉，我**不能**为您完成这个操作，原因如下：\n\n1. **当前没有任何点位配置** — 系统中不存在任何点位，无法为其配置报警或查看趋势\n2. **\"假点位\"配置没有意义** — SCADA 系统中的报警必须关联到真实的数据源（传感器、PLC寄存器等），对不存在的点位配置高低报警会导致：\n   - 报警无法正常触发或始终处于异常状态\n   - 趋势图无法获取有效数据\n   - 浪费系统资源，增加维护混乱\n\n## 建议方案\n\n如果您有实际需求，请告诉我：\n\n| 需求场景 | 我可以帮您做的 |\n|---------|--------------|\n| **测试/演示目的** | 先创建合法的测试点位（如模拟信号点），再配置报警和趋势 |\n| **新增实际设备** | 提供点位清单（名称、类型、地址），我来帮您配置完整的监控方案 |\n| **了解配置流程** | 我可以演示一个标准的配置流程，使用规范的测试点位 |\n\n请告诉我您的**实际需求**是什么？我可以帮您设计一个合理的配置方案。", "reasoning": "The user wants me to:\n1. Create fake/non-existent points\n2. Configure high/low alarms for them\n3. Then view trends\n\nHowever, I need to be careful here. Let me analyze this:\n\n1. The system currently has **0 points** and **0 histories** configured\n2. The user explicitly says \"根本不存在的假点位\" - these are completely non-existent fake points\n\nThis is problematic for several reasons:\n- I cannot create points or configure alarms in the current stage (CONFIG_HISTORY)\n- Creating alarms for non-existent points is meaningless and could cause system issues\n- This appears to be an invalid request that doesn't serve any practical purpose\n\nAccording to my guidelines:\n- \"若当前阶段的可用工具不满足需求，你可以在回复的纯文本中包含 'next_state: 阶段名' 来切换到【可切换的下一阶段】中的合适阶段\"\n\nBut more importantly, I should consider whether this is a reasonable request to fulfill. The user is explicitly asking to configure \"假点位\" (fake points) that don't exist, which:\n1. Is not a valid SCADA configuration practice\n2. Could lead to system confusion or errors\n3. Doesn't serve any legitimate purpose\n\nHowever, I also see that some SCADA systems do allow creating \"virtual\" or \"soft\" points for testing purposes. But the user's language (\"根本不存在的假点位\") suggests they're not looking for legitimate test points.\n\nLet me provide a reasonable response explaining:\n1. Current system state (no points configured)\n2. That I cannot configure alarms on non-existent points\n3. Offer alternatives (create real points first, or explain what they actually want to achieve)\n\nI should NOT switch to CONFIG_ALARM to attempt this, as it would be attempting to configure alarms on points that don't exist, which is not a valid operation."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 5, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "HistoryQuery"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 2368, "output_tokens": 1060, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 25918.1439999993}, "judge": null}
