: "tool_use", "text": "我来帮您为 PUMP_A_RUN 配置运行反馈消失报警。首先让我检查一下该点位是否存在。", "reasoning": "The user wants to configure an alarm for PUMP_A_RUN point - specifically a \"running feedback disappearance\" alarm with high priority. \n\nTo configure an alarm, I need to know if the point PUMP_A_RUN exists first. Let me check the available points to verify this point exists and understand its type.\n\nAccording to my current stage (ANALYZE_INTENT) and available tools, I can:\n1. Use manage_points with action list_points to check existing points\n2. Use manage_pages with action list_pages to list pages\n\nSince I'm in the AlarmConfig workflow step \"discover_points\", I should first verify the point exists before configuring an alarm for it. Let me list the points to check if PUMP_A_RUN exists.\n\nHowever, looking at the tools available, I don't have an alarm configuration tool yet. The current stage is ANALYZE_INTENT and the next states include CONFIG_ALARM. I should first verify the point exists, then transition to CONFIG_ALARM stage to configure the alarm.\n\nLet me first query the points to verify PUMP_A_RUN exists."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1874, "output_tokens": 343, "latency_ms": 10636.17770000019, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "点位 PUMP_A_RUN 已确认存在，类型为 digital。\n\n但是我需要向您说明一个重要问题：\n\n**当前工具限制：** `create_digital_alarm` 功能是当布尔标签变为 **true** 时触发报警。而\"运行反馈消失\"通常意味着点位从 true 变为 **false**。\n\n**可能的解决方案：**\n1. 如果您系统中已配置了取反点位（如 `PUMP_A_NOT_RUNNING` 或 `PUMP_A_RUN_STATUS_INV`），我可以为该取反点位配置报警\n2. 或者，您可以确认 PUMP_A_RUN 的含义——如果它是\"运行故障\"信号（true=故障），则直接使用它配置报警\n\n请问您的系统中是否有 PUMP_A_RUN 的取反点位？或者 PUMP_A_RUN 本身是故障信号？请提供正确的报警触发点位标签，我将为您完成配置。", "reasoning": "用户要为 PUMP_A_RUN 配置运行反馈消失报警，优先级 high。这是一个数字量点位，报警类型应该是数字报警。\n\n\"运行反馈消失\"意味着当该点变为 false（即运行反馈消失）时触发报警。但当前可用的 create_digital_alarm 是\"fires when a boolean tag becomes true\"，即当点位变为 true 时触发。\n\n为了实现\"运行反馈消失\"报警，我需要考虑：\n1. 可能需要一个取反的点位（如 PUMP_A_NOT_RUNNING）\n2. 或者询问用户是否有其他方式处理\n\n让我先向用户确认这一点，因为 create_digital_alarm 只能在 tag 变为 true 时触发。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 5, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "AlarmConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 2835, "output_tokens": 622, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 17675.044600000547}, "judge": null}
