args": {"action": "create_analog_alarm", "id": "alarm_PT_COMP_01_H", "tag": "PT_COMP_01", "high_limit": "2.8", "low_limit": "0.0", "deadband": "0", "priority": "medium"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": false, "error_code": "ALREADY_EXISTS", "error_msg": "alarm alarm_PT_COMP_01_H already exists", "result_data": {}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.8733000013307901, "intended_entities": ["alarms.alarm_PT_COMP_01_H"], "referenced_entities": ["points.PT_COMP_01"]}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:576dd46c892d0c478ef4b7488319f2e1c34a7300eb6d42b30de204ee1da452a3", "final_hash": "sha256:dafd917d1b1d6f1d93dcd88a6e239e2b7cc3b9fe6307cc0986c63c57648c907c", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 972, "output_tokens": 208, "latency_ms": 6250.205700000151, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户要求为点位PT_COMP_01配置H（高）和HH（高高）报警，具体参数为：H=2.8（medium报警级别），HH=3.2（high报警级别）。\n\n当前阶段是ANALYZE_INTENT，我需要先理解用户意图。用户想要配置报警，这属于报警配置（CONFIG_ALARM）的范畴。但根据工作流上下文，当前workflow是AlarmConfig，step是discover_points。这意味着我们处于报警配置流程的点位发现阶段。\n\n可用工具只有manage_pages和manage_points，且当前允许的操作只有list_pages和list_points。要配置报警，我需要先确认点位PT_COMP_01是否存在。我应该使用manage_points工具来列出点位，看看PT_COMP_01是否存在。\n\n让我先调用manage_points的list_points操作来查看所有点位。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1818, "output_tokens": 592, "latency_ms": 12277.264800000921, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户要求为PT_COMP_01点位配置H和HH报警，具体为：H=2.8 medium，HH=3.2 high。当前阶段是CONFIG_ALARM，可用工具是manage_alarms，且当前允许的actions包括create_analog_alarm、create_digital_alarm、set_threshold、disable_alarm、enable_alarm。PT_COMP_01是一个模拟量点位（analog），因此需要创建模拟量报警。\n\n用户提到了两个报警级别：H（高）和HH（高高）。在SCADA中，这通常意味着需要为同一个点位创建两个独立的报警：一个用于高限（H=2.8），另一个用于高高限（HH=3.2）。每个报警都需要唯一的ID。我需要为这两个报警定义ID。可以考虑使用类似\"alarm_PT_COMP_01_H\"和\"alarm_PT_COMP_01_HH\"这样的命名。\n\n我需要调用create_analog_alarm两次。第一次调用：action=\"create_analog_alarm\"，id=\"alarm_PT_COMP_01_H\"，tag=\"PT_COMP_01\"，high_limit=2.8，low_limit=null（因为没有提到低限），deadband=0.0（默认值），priority=\"medium\"。第二次调用：action=\"create_analog_alarm\"，id=\"alarm_PT_COMP_01_HH\"，tag=\"PT_COMP_01\"，high_limit=3.2，low_limit=null，deadband=0.0，priority=\"high\"。\n\n我需要确认deadband参数：用户没有指定死区，因此使用默认值0.0。优先级参数：用户指定了H为medium，HH为high。需要确保high_limit参数正确设置。另外，用户没有提到low_limit，所以设为null。\n\n现在，我可以同时调用这两个工具，因为它们之间没有依赖关系。让我开始执行。"}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2529, "output_tokens": 296, "latency_ms": 6626.019899998937, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "收到错误信息：low_limit 参数需要是有效的数字，但无法将字符串解析为数字。我传递的是 \"None\" 字符串，而实际上应该传递 JSON null。让我检查参数类型定义：low_limit 的类型是 `anyOf: [number, null]`，所以我应该直接传递 null 值，而不是字符串 \"None\"。\n\n让我重新调用，这次直接使用 null 值（在 JSON 中表示为 null）。同时调用两个创建模拟报警的工具。"}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2944, "output_tokens": 327, "latency_ms": 8198.779399999694, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "The issue is with the low_limit parameter. Looking at the schema, low_limit accepts either a number or null. The error message says \"Input should be a valid number, unable to parse string as a number\". It seems like the tool is receiving \"None\" as a string instead of null.\n\nLooking at the schema more carefully:\n```json\n\"low_limit\": {\"anyOf\": [{\"type\": \"number\"}, {\"type\": \"null\"}], \"default\": null, \"title\": \"Low Limit\"}\n```\n\nSo it should accept null. The issue might be that I'm passing \"None\" as a string. Let me try without passing low_limit at all since it has a default of null. Or I might need to pass it as a JSON null value.\n\nLet me try omitting the low_limit parameter entirely since it has a default value of null."}, {"turn": 5, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 3676, "output_tokens": 390, "latency_ms": 8761.577600000237, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户要求为PT_COMP_01配置H和HH报警，H=2.8 medium，HH=3.2 high。当前处于CONFIG_ALARM阶段，可用工具有manage_alarms和manage_notifications。我需要使用manage_alarms工具创建两个模拟报警：一个H报警（2.8，medium优先级）和一个HH报警（3.2，high优先级）。\n\n之前尝试调用manage_alarms时出现了SCHEMA_ERROR，错误信息是\"create_analog_alarm.low_limit: Input should be a valid number, unable to parse string as a number\"。这表明在JSON序列化过程中，low_limit参数的null值可能被转换成了字符串\"None\"，导致验证失败。根据工具定义，low_limit参数类型是anyOf: [number, null]，默认值是null。这意味着它应该接受数字或null值。问题可能在于我将null作为Python None传递，但在序列化时变成了字符串\"None\"。我需要确保传递真正的null值。在JSON中，null应该直接表示为null。我可以尝试在参数中明确设置low_limit为null，或者完全省略该参数（因为它有默认值null）。\n\n让我先尝试一个报警，只包含必需参数，省略可选参数。根据工具定义，必需参数是id、tag、action。high_limit、low_limit、deadband、priority都是可选的（有默认值）。我应该只提供必需参数，让其他参数使用默认值。"}, {"turn": 6, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 4140, "output_tokens": 398, "latency_ms": 9557.590600001276, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户要求为PT_COMP_01点位配置H（高）和HH（高高）报警，H=2.8 medium，HH=3.2 high。当前阶段是CONFIG_ALARM，可用工具是manage_alarms。之前尝试调用manage_alarms的create_analog_alarm动作时遇到了SCHEMA_ERROR，提示\"Input should be a valid number, unable to parse string as a number\"。这个错误似乎是关于low_limit参数的，即使我没有显式传递low_limit参数。这可能是工具内部对null值的处理有问题。\n\n让我仔细查看工具的JSON Schema。对于create_analog_alarm，参数定义中low_limit是\"anyOf: [{\"type\": \"number\"}, {\"type\": \"null\"}]\"，并且有\"default\": null。这意味着low_limit应该可以接受null值。但是错误信息表明工具期望一个数字，却收到了一个字符串。可能是工具实现有问题，或者参数传递方式有问题。\n\n我需要尝试不同的方法。也许我需要显式传递low_limit为数字0？或者尝试只设置high_limit而不设置low_limit？让我再仔细看看错误信息：\"create_analog_alarm.low_limit: Input should be a valid number, unable to parse string as a number\"。这表明工具内部在尝试将low_limit解析为数字，但收到了一个字符串。可能是工具的验证逻辑有问题，把null值当成了字符串。\n\n让我尝试另一种方法：创建报警时只提供必需参数，不提供可选参数。必需参数是id、tag和action。high_limit、low_limit、deadband、priority都是可选的。让我先尝试只提供必需参数，看看是否成功。"}, {"turn": 7, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 4612, "output_tokens": 234, "latency_ms": 5701.01429999886, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "看起来有一个schema验证问题。工具期望low_limit是number或null类型，但即使我不传递low_limit参数，它仍然报错说无法解析字符串为数字。这可能是一个工具实现的问题。\n\n让我尝试传递一个具体的数字值作为low_limit，比如0，来避免null值的问题。"}, {"turn": 8, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 4965, "output_tokens": 356, "latency_ms": 10347.93769999851, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "The issue is that the tool keeps rejecting the low_limit parameter with a schema error. Even when I pass a numeric value like 0, it says \"unable to parse string as a number\". This suggests there might be an issue with how the parameter is being passed. \n\nLet me try passing the parameters with numeric values without quotes. The error says \"unable to parse string as a number\" - this could mean the value is being passed as a string instead of a number. Let me be very careful about the types.\n\nActually, looking at my previous calls, I was passing numbers correctly. Let me try passing low_limit as a float (0.0) instead of integer (0), just to be sure.\n\nWait, the error message seems to indicate it's trying to parse a string but can't. Maybe there's something wrong with how the tool is receiving the parameter. Let me try with explicit float values for all numeric parameters.\n\nAlso, I notice the schema says low_limit has default null. Maybe I should just not pass low_limit at all if I don't need it. Let me try that again but be more careful about not including any optional parameters that aren't needed.\n\nActually wait, I tried that already and got the same error. This is strange. Let me try one more time with just the bare minimum required parameters and see if I can get it to work."}, {"turn": 9, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 5395, "output_tokens": 593, "latency_ms": 14355.39559999961, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "The user wants to configure H and HH alarms for PT_COMP_01. I'm in CONFIG_ALARM stage. Available tool is manage_alarms. I need to create two analog alarms: one for H limit at 2.8 with medium priority, and one for HH limit at 3.2 with high priority.\n\nThe error keeps happening: \"create_analog_alarm.low_limit: Input should be a 