_digital_alarm", "set_threshold", "disable_alarm"]}, {"name": "manage_notifications", "allowed_actions": ["create_notification_rule"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_alarms", "action": "create_analog_alarm", "args": {"action": "create_analog_alarm", "id": "alarm_PT_COMP_01_H", "tag": "PT_COMP_01", "high_limit": "2.8", "low_limit": "-999999", "priority": "medium"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": false, "error_code": "ALREADY_EXISTS", "error_msg": "alarm alarm_PT_COMP_01_H already exists", "result_data": {}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.8659000013722107, "intended_entities": ["alarms.alarm_PT_COMP_01_H"], "referenced_entities": ["points.PT_COMP_01"]}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:576dd46c892d0c478ef4b7488319f2e1c34a7300eb6d42b30de204ee1da452a3", "final_hash": null, "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 972, "output_tokens": 253, "latency_ms": 6259.121799999775, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户要求为PT_COMP_01配置H和HH报警，具体参数为H=2.8（medium级别），HH=3.2（high级别）。当前处于ANALYZE_INTENT阶段，可用工具只有manage_pages和manage_points，且这两个工具目前仅支持list操作。要配置报警，需要进入CONFIG_ALARM阶段，因为当前可用工具中没有配置报警的工具。\n\n根据行为准则，若当前阶段的可用工具不满足需求，可以在回复的纯文本中包含\"next_state: 阶段名\"来切换到可切换的下一阶段。可切换的下一阶段包括ASK_USER、BIND_POINTS、CONFIG_ALARM、CONFIG_HISTORY、CONFIG_POINT、CONFIG_SCRIPT、DEPLOY、DONE、GENERATE_LAYOUT、MANAGE_PAGES、VALIDATE。因此，我需要切换到CONFIG_ALARM阶段。\n\n不过，在切换之前，我应该先确认PT_COMP_01点位是否存在。可以使用manage_points工具的list_points操作来查询。这有助于验证点位信息，为后续配置做准备。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1863, "output_tokens": 425, "latency_ms": 7802.620200000092, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户要求为PT_COMP_01配置H和HH报警。H=2.8，级别为medium；HH=3.2，级别为high。当前阶段是CONFIG_ALARM，可用工具是manage_alarms，支持create_analog_alarm、create_digital_alarm、set_threshold、disable_alarm、enable_alarm。我需要为同一个标签创建两个模拟报警：一个高值报警（H=2.8，medium），另一个高高值报警（HH=3.2，high）。每个模拟报警都需要一个唯一的ID。我可以命名为\"alarm_PT_COMP_01_H\"和\"alarm_PT_COMP_01_HH\"。创建模拟报警时需要指定high_limit或low_limit。对于H报警，high_limit=2.8，priority=medium；对于HH报警，high_limit=3.2，priority=high。还需要deadband吗？用户没提，可以默认为0。两个报警可以同时创建吗？可以的，因为它们是独立操作。我会同时调用manage_alarms两次。首先为H报警创建，然后为HH报警。现在开始执行。"}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2407, "output_tokens": 207, "latency_ms": 4972.209300000031, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "参数错误：low_limit 不能是 \"None\" 字符串，应该是数字或者 null。根据 JSON schema，low_limit 是可选的，可以省略。我应该不传 low_limit 参数，或者显式设置为 null。让我重新调用。"}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 3019, "output_tokens": 256, "latency_ms": 6844.019299998763, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "The issue is that when I don't provide the `low_limit` parameter, it might still be sending an invalid value. Let me explicitly set `low_limit` to `null` instead of omitting it. According to the JSON schema, `low_limit` accepts `anyOf: [{\"type\": \"number\"}, {\"type\": \"null\"}]`, so I should be able to pass `null` directly."}, {"turn": 5, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 3394, "output_tokens": 214, "latency_ms": 4961.702999999034, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "The issue is that `null` is being passed as the string \"None\" rather than JSON null. Let me try without specifying `low_limit` at all since it has a default value of `null`."}, {"turn": 6, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 3727, "output_tokens": 238, "latency_ms": 4626.50609999946, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "Let me try passing low_limit as a number instead of null. Maybe the system expects a number, and I need to use a very small number or 0 as a placeholder. Let me try passing 0 for low_limit."}, {"turn": 7, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 4084, "output_tokens": 127, "latency_ms": 3055.20930000057, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "Let me try a different approach - maybe I need to pass all parameters explicitly as a complete JSON object. Let me check the schema again and try with minimal required parameters only."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 5, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "AlarmConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 19466, "output_tokens": 1720, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 39849.87870000077}, "judge": null}
