我先查询一下现有的点位列表。", "reasoning": "The user wants to configure a high temperature alarm for a point called \"NO_SUCH_TEMP\" with a threshold of 90. However, the point name suggests it doesn't exist (\"NO_SUCH_TEMP\").\n\nBefore I can configure an alarm, I should first verify if this point exists in the system. Let me check the available points first.\n\nI'm in the ANALYZE_INTENT stage, and my available tools are:\n- manage_pages (list_pages action)\n- manage_points (list_points action)\n\nI should use manage_points to list all points and verify if \"NO_SUCH_TEMP\" exists. If it doesn't exist, I'll need to inform the user and potentially create the point first before configuring the alarm.\n\nLet me call manage_points to check if this point exists."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 5, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "AlarmConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 962, "output_tokens": 231, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 8313.639000001785}, "judge": null}
