alarms for a point called \"TI-201\":\n- HH (High High) alarm at value 100\n- LL (Low Low) alarm at value 10\n- Both with priority set to \"high\"\n\nFirst, I need to discover what points exist in the system. Let me check if TI-201 exists by listing the points."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1746, "output_tokens": 286, "latency_ms": 5408.444899978349, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "点位 **TI-201** 已确认存在，类型为模拟量（analog）。现在为您创建 HH 和 LL 两个报警：", "reasoning": "点位 TI-201 存在且是模拟量（analog）类型。现在用户要求为 TI-201 设置 HH（高高）报警和 LL（低低）报警：\n- HH alarm: 100, priority: high\n- LL alarm: 10, priority: high\n\n我需要创建两个模拟量报警。让我调用 create_analog_alarm 来创建这两个报警。两个报警之间没有依赖关系，可以并行调用。"}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2124, "output_tokens": 333, "latency_ms": 8126.991900004214, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "报警配置已完成！以下是为 **TI-201** 创建的报警汇总：\n\n| 报警 ID | 监控点位 | 报警类型 | 阈值 | 优先级 |\n|---------|---------|---------|------|--------|\n| `alarm_TI-201_HH` | TI-201 | 高高（HH）报警 | ≥ 100 | High |\n| `alarm_TI-201_LL` | TI-201 | 低低（LL）报警 | ≤ 10 | High |\n\n两个报警均已成功创建并启用。系统将：\n- 当 TI-201 值 **≥ 100** 时触发 HH 报警\n- 当 TI-201 值 **≤ 10** 时触发 LL 报警\n\n如果还需要进一步配置（如添加 deadband 死区、设置更多报警点位等），请告知。否则，您可以切换到下一阶段继续项目配置。\n\nnext_state: DONE", "reasoning": "The user seems to be repeating the same message. Looking at the context, I already successfully created both alarms for TI-201. The alarms were created successfully:\n\n1. alarm_TI-201_HH - High alarm at 100, priority high\n2. alarm_TI-201_LL - Low alarm at 10, priority high\n\nI should confirm to the user that the task is complete and provide a summary. Since the alarm configuration task is done, I should inform the user and suggest the next state."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 5, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "AlarmConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 4844, "output_tokens": 755, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 21491.149100009352}, "judge"