g properly. Let me try a different approach - perhaps I need to explicitly pass `null` as a JSON null value, not as the string \"None\".\n\nLet me try passing `low_limit` as `null` explicitly."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 5, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "AlarmConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 38594, "output_tokens": 3162, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 78575.46860000002}, "judge": null}
